{"title":"Rimeworm Elder","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 63 Rimeworm that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-2844.8px,1808.2px)\"><i style=\"left:2844.8px;top:-1808.2px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around -141, -1175 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"rimeworm-elder\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Rimeworm: <a href=\"#/monster/rimeworm-hatchling\">Rimeworm Hatchling</a> <span class=\"muted\">(60)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rimeworm\">Rimeworm</a> <span class=\"muted\">(62)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rimeworm-queen\">Rimeworm Queen</a> <span class=\"muted\">(64)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/dda05deae66056251fa0.svg\" alt=\"Rimeworm Elder\"></div><h3>Rimeworm Elder</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>63 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 63–63)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Rimeworm</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>476